        <profile name="Obsessive Bloodlust" id="915f-f2fc-a2ff-796e" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Once per turning point, when an operative with this rule ends the **Fight** action, if it&apos;s no longer within control range of enemy operatives, you can use this rule. If you do, it can immediately perform a free **Charge** action (even if it&apos;s already performed the **Charge** action during that activation), but cannot move more than 2&quot; during that action. Doing so doesn&apos;t prevent it from performing the **Charge**, **Dash** or **Reposition** action afterwards during that activation.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
