          <rules>
            <rule name="*Ritual" id="6537-290c-4bd6-524f" hidden="false">
              <description>Whenever this operative is using this weapon, the first time you inflict damage on an operative within its control range during that sequence, you can increase this operative&apos;s GORE TANK. Note this is cumulative with the normal rules for increasing its GORE TANK (i.e. if it incapacitates an operative within its control range).</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
